{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-37","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-37-talk-403813901-line","text":"你走进圆形房间，绳索捆绑一株枝桠纯白的树。你惊讶于它的纯美，通体圣洁，它像一尊舞动雕像。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-37-talk-403813902-line","text":"你注意到树旁倚坐数名士兵，你不确定他们是否睡着了。他们是虔诚的骑士，每人的皮肤都不带血色。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-37-talk-403813903-line","text":"你也不受控制地走近它。你听到碎裂缓慢的树涛声。你看到树根旁的一块木牌：「用…浇灌…它将…盛开。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-37-text-17596320478228389567-choice","text":"解构它的生命逻辑。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-37-text-8389439776888507949-choice","text":"换取1个2星祝福","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-37-text-3202456188995855770-choice","text":"换取1个3星祝福","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-37-text-16127782175284818846-choice","text":"离开","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-37-text-8889152373770225796-effect","text":"你不愿浇灌它。","speaker":""}]}
